    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Contorted Epitome",
    "summary": "As [your opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, you can use this ability with only one of your **PSYKER** models that has it. If you do, pick an enemy unit [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to that model and up to 12\" from it, and roll a D6:\n\n- 1: that **PSYKER** model takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)\n- 2-5: attacks by models in that enemy unit get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the phase\n- 6: that enemy unit cannot shoot in the phase",
